#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:1
msgid "E4015"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:3
msgid "Type has no method with the specified name."
msgstr "类型没有指定名称的方法。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:5
msgid "Erroneous Example"
msgstr "错误示例："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:7
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn shout() -> String {\n"
"  \"hey\".upper()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:11
msgid ""
"The above example tries to call an inexistent method `upper()` on a "
"string literal, giving the following error on line 1:"
msgstr "上述例子中，试图对字符串常量调用一个不存在的方法 `upper()`，在第 1 行报错："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:14
msgid "Type String has no method upper.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:20
msgid ""
"This is usually a typo or a misunderstanding of the methods available. "
"Please make sure to use the correct method name:"
msgstr "这通常是因为一个拼写错误或对可用方法的误解。请确保使用正确的方法名称："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn shout() -> String {\n"
"  \"hey\".to_upper()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4015.md:27
msgid ""
"If the missing method belongs to a trait, an `impl Trait for Type` "
"declaration does not by itself guarantee that the method can be called "
"with dot syntax. Call it explicitly as `Trait::method(value, ...)`, or "
"attach the method with `extend Type with Trait::{method}`. Use `pub "
"extend` if callers in other packages should also be able to use dot "
"syntax. See [attaching trait methods with `extend`](../methods.md"
"#attaching-trait-methods-with-extend)."
msgstr ""
"如果缺少的方法属于某个特征，仅有 `impl Trait for Type` 声明并不保证可以用点语法调用该方法。"
"可以显式调用 `Trait::method(value, ...)`，或通过 `extend Type with Trait::{method}` "
"将方法附加到类型。如果其他包中的调用者也需要使用点语法，请使用 `pub extend`。"
"参见[使用 `extend` 附加特征方法](../methods.md#attaching-trait-methods-with-extend)。"
